<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Sorry for my late reply</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">MEMI</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">M3MI</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2jt6PzDKvyi9gcwILysaep</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.727" end="00:26.280">낯선 번호 전화가 왔어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.280" end="00:29.593">아무도 전화를 안받아 내게 결국 걸었대</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.593" end="00:31.093">어려운 말로,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.893" end="00:32.416">죽음을 돌려말해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.416" end="00:34.769">……</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.769" end="00:36.269">그가 떠났대</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.514" end="00:37.014">오, 갑자기</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.669" end="00:38.169">기억나,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.400" end="00:38.900">3일 전</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.095" end="00:40.143">알수없던 이상한 메세지</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.143" end="00:42.660">답장을 망설이다</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.660" end="00:44.160">안했어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.155" end="00:46.985" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(you don’t deserve it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.985" end="00:48.485">대체 왜그랬어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.416" end="00:51.264">무슨 용기로 그랬어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.264" end="00:54.310">되돌릴 수가 없어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.310" end="00:57.709">If I, If I'd replied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.709" end="00:59.209">replied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.961" end="01:00.557">끝까지 나빠</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.557" end="01:03.110">잠든 네 모습을 봐</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.110" end="01:04.610">you don’t deserve this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.486" end="01:06.616">꿈에서 만나줘</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.616" end="01:09.148">Sorry for my late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.148" end="01:12.737">reply</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.737" end="01:15.132">If I, If I'd replied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.132" end="01:19.225">replied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.225" end="01:21.141">If I, If I'd replied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.141" end="01:24.197">replied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.197" end="01:32.197" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.850" end="01:35.366">아직 준비가 안됐는데</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.366" end="01:39.170">온기없는 그의 몸에 책임감을 느끼네</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.170" end="01:40.772">혼신의 연기를 해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.772" end="01:42.272">사고로 위장해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.655" end="01:43.157">…….</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.157" end="01:44.943">난 슬픔 삼키며 공연을 해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.943" end="01:47.707">거짓말을 해야 해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.707" end="01:50.142">나의 youth에 당신이 비었네</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.142" end="01:52.096">답장을 안 한</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.096" end="01:54.087">내 잘못일까</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.087" end="01:56.224" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I deserve this)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.224" end="01:57.787">대체 왜그랬어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.787" end="02:00.704">무슨 용기로 그랬어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.704" end="02:03.770">되돌릴 수가 없어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.770" end="02:07.028">If I, If I'd replied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.028" end="02:08.540">replied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.540" end="02:10.040">끝까지 나빠</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.733" end="02:12.358">잠든 네 모습을 봐</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.358" end="02:13.904">you don’t deserve this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.904" end="02:16.165">꿈에서 만나줘</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.165" end="02:18.585">Sorry for my late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.585" end="02:20.085">reply</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.657" end="02:27.657">대체 왜그랬어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.733" end="02:47.224">무슨 용기로 그랬어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.224" end="02:49.880">되돌릴 수가 없어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.880" end="02:52.678">If I, If I'd replied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.678" end="02:54.418">replied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.418" end="02:55.918">끝까지 나빠</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.778" end="02:58.647">잠든 네 모습을 봐</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.647" end="03:00.147">you don’t deserve this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.021" end="03:02.395">꿈에서 만나줘</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.395" end="03:04.725">Sorry for my late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.725" end="03:06.225">reply</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.102" end="03:10.921">Sorry for my late reply</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.921" end="03:16.475">Sorry for my late reply</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.475" end="03:22.262">Sorry for my late reply</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.262" end="03:26.262">Sorry for my late reply</p></div></body></tt>